{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.gamechangesns.GCVCardReader\/documentation\/GCVCardReader"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"GVCCardReader is a comprehensive framework designed to facilitate end-to-end Know Your Customer (KYC) verification for users residing in the United Arab Emirates. The framework offers a streamlined identity verification pipeline comprising the following key stages:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Identity Document Acquisition: GVCCardReader supports two methods for capturing Emirates ID card data. Users may leverage the device’s Near Field Communication (NFC) capability to read card data electronically, or alternatively, use the device camera to perform Optical Character Recognition (OCR) on the physical card."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Document Validation: Once the Emirates ID data is acquired, it is submitted to the Identity and Citizenship Authority (ICA) API for verification, ensuring the authenticity and integrity of the captured information."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Liveness Detection: Following successful document validation, the framework conducts a liveness assessment to confirm that the verification is being performed by a physically present individual, rather than a spoofed or static representation."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Biometric Face Comparison: As a final step, a face comparison is performed between the portrait captured during the liveness test and the photograph on the Emirates ID, confirming that the individual undergoing verification matches the document holder."}]}]}]}]}],"var